sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ESP as ESP32 Device
    participant Broker as MQTT Broker (TLS/ACL)
    participant Worker as MQTT Worker Process
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/PostGIS
    participant Logic as Domain Services
    participant API as FastAPI REST
    participant UI as Admin Web UI

    ESP->>Broker: Publish JSON to smartwaste/device/{device_id}/telemetry
    Broker->>Worker: Forward message after ACL check
    Worker->>Worker: Validate topic ID, JSON schema, schema_version
    alt malformed, unknown, revoked, or identity mismatch
        Worker->>DB: Store redacted rejected_telemetry_events + reason
        Worker-->>Broker: ACK delivery; no domain side effects
    else valid message
        Worker->>DB: Resolve active device_bin_assignment
        Worker->>DB: Deduplicate (device_id, boot_id, sequence)
        alt duplicate message
            Worker-->>Broker: ACK duplicate; do not insert twice
        else new message
            Worker->>DB: Load current calibration/version
            Worker->>Worker: Validate measurements; compute fill_percent server-side
            Worker->>DB: Insert immutable sensor_reading + received_at + quality
            Worker->>DB: Upsert bin_latest_state
            Worker->>Logic: Trigger eligible alert/candidate rules
            Logic->>DB: Persist alerts/candidates idempotently
        end
    end
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/readings/latest
    API->>DB: Query latest eligible readings/state
    DB-->>API: JSON-serializable records
    API-->>UI: HTTPS JSON response
